                    <span class="hrelev-fecha">05/10/2026</span>
                </div><div class="hrelev-enlace">
                    <a href="/docs/Documentos/esp/hechosrelev/2026/20260930_Bradesco%20-%20Notice%20Approval.pdf" target="_blank" class="pdf"><span class="tam">75 KB</span> Ratification of the Capital Increase by Bradesco’s Board of Directors</a>
                </div></div><div><div class="hrelev-datos">
                    <span class="hrelev-clase"><strong>Hecho Relevante</strong>: Aumentos y reducciones del capital social                                                           </span>
                    <span class="hrelev-hora">09:32</span>
                    <span class="hrelev-fecha">02/10/2026</span>
                </div><div class="hrelev-enlace">
                    <a href="/docs/Documentos/esp/hechosrelev/2026/20261002_Bradesco_auction%20unsuscribed%20shares.pdf" target="_blank" class="pdf"><span class="tam">100 KB</span> Auction of Unsubscribed Shares remaining from the Capital Increase through the Subscription of New Shares</a>
                </div></div><div><div class="hrelev-datos">
                    <span class="hrelev-clase"><strong>Hecho Relevante</strong>: Información sobre dividendos                                                                        </span>
                    <span class="hrelev-hora">09:31</span>
